{"id":229,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"硬教育と英才早教育で学力・人間力・国際力を磨く","feature_description":"巣鴨学園は、努力を重ねて自らの可能性を引き出す「硬教育」を教育の柱に掲げます。中高6年一貫の英才早教育では、難関大学受験に対応する学力だけでなく、人間力と国際力も育成します。授業、行事、班活動などを通じて経験を重ね、将来、実社会で力強く活躍できる人材を目指します。日々の努力を続けることを大切にし、学びと活動の両面から生徒の成長を支えます。","clubs":[{"id":14953,"name":"羽球班(バドミントン部)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sugamo.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":14954,"name":"山岳班(山岳部)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sugamo.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":14955,"name":"中学蹴球班(サッカー部)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sugamo.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":14956,"name":"水泳班(水泳部)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sugamo.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":14957,"name":"スキー班(スキー部)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sugamo.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":14958,"name":"排球班(バレー部)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sugamo.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":14959,"name":"中学野球班(軟式野球部)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sugamo.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":14960,"name":"中学籠球班(バスケットボール部)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sugamo.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":14961,"name":"中学硬式庭球班(硬式テニス部)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sugamo.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":14962,"name":"吹奏楽班(吹奏楽部)","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.sugamo.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":14963,"name":"生物班(生物部)","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.sugamo.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":14964,"name":"折り紙研究会","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.sugamo.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":15033,"name":"中学ソフトテニス班","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sugamo.ed.jp/school_life/","verified_at":"2026-11-19"},{"id":15034,"name":"中学剣道班","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.